<title>USA: RESEARCH ALERT - Duriron started as buy.</title>
<headline>RESEARCH ALERT - Duriron started as buy.</headline>
<text>
<p>--Rauscher Pierce Refsnes analyst Holden Lewis said he started coverage of Duriron Co Inc with a buy-market outperformer rating.</p>
<p>--Shares in the maker of pumps, valves, seals and other products closed off 9/16 to 26-1/2 on Thursday.</p>
<p>--Lewis said he expects Duriron to earn $1.90 per share in 1996, versus $1.42 in 1995.</p>
<p>-- Chicago Newsdesk 312-408-8787</p>
</text>
